    fix: play media again on a Windows logoff or shutdown, and report unfinished scripts

    session-end now starts an Electron quit and will-quit holds the exit for the orderly
    quit, so the resume runs before the process ends. A pause whose await outran its cap
    stays held as unconfirmed, a resume without its closing line counts as failed, and the
    quit tests drive the real handlers instead of reading the source.

